      "prompt": "A 95% confidence interval for a population mean mu is (12, 20). Based only on this interval, a two-sided significance test of H0: mu = 10 versus Ha: mu != 10 at the alpha = 0.05 level would:\n(A) fail to reject H0.\n(B) reject H0.\n(C) be impossible to decide.\n(D) accept H0 as true.",
